<FONT FACE="Helvetica, Arial"><B>
Use this form to sign up for a money-saving discount membership
to the Ventura Roadrunners RC Club. ($20/yr. single - $25/yr. family) Membership entitles you to 
a $3.00 savings per race. ($7.00 - members, $10.00 - non-members)
Races consist of 3 heats and a main race. Prizes are given to 
the first, second and third place finishers as well as a "top
qualifier" for each class of racing.
<p>
Roadrunner members are entitled to a 20% discount at Arrowcraft Hobbies in Camarillo, CA. which stocks
all the hop ups and replacement parts for your RC car/truck. Say 
hello to Donny at Arrowcraft and tell him you saw his name mentioned
in our website.
</B></FONT><br>
